### Nowa karta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currencyCode": "PLN"
}

> {%
    client.global.set('number', response.body.number);
%}

### Wpłata
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards/{{number}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "IN",
  "amount": 200,
  "currencyCode": "PLN"
}

### Płatność
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards/{{number}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "OUT",
  "amount": 100,
  "currencyCode": "PLN"
}

### Brak środków -> 422 (Problem Details)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards/{{number}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: pl

{
  "type": "OUT",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currencyCode": "PLN"
}

### Błąd walidacji -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards/{{number}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "OUT",
  "amount": -5,
  "currencyCode": "pln"
}

### Karta
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cards/{{number}}

### Lista kart
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cards?pageIndex=0&pageSize=10

### Płatność w obcej walucie (przeliczenie + 2% prowizji)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards/{{number}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "OUT",
  "amount": 10,
  "currencyCode": "EUR"
}

### Zamówienie opłacone kartą
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Pizza",
  "cardNumber": "{{number}}",
  "amount": 40,
  "currencyCode": "PLN"
}

### Zamówienia opłacone kartą (endpoint przeniesiony do orders)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders?cardNumber={{number}}
